# cash_discount — dbt project

Personal dbt project for **cash_discount** analytics and modeling. Shared **ap_core** models install from the ap_core package (`packages.yml` + `dbt deps`).
Workspace: `C:\dbt\cash_discount`

## Before making changes

Read the decision log for the scope you are changing:

| Scope | Log |
|-------|-----|
| Shared AP core (facts, terms, map, neutral timing, CD/WCO arbitration) | `C:\dbt\ap_core\docs\core_decisions.md` (canonical, ap_core repo) |
| Cash discount product (leakage, V6 attribution, CD marts, curriculum) | `docs/decisions.md` |

- Follow conventions in this rule file and in that log.
- **Core** grains/columns: ap_core `docs/core_decisions.md` wins over `docs/decisions.md` until CD docs are updated explicitly.

ap_core `docs/core_decisions.md` structure: Project context → Architecture (stable chapter) → Open questions → Decisions → Model inventory → Conventions → Chat handoff notes.

## Model layering

| Layer | Folder | Materialization | Naming |
|-------|--------|-----------------|--------|
| Sources / staging | `models/src/` | ephemeral or view | `src_<entity>.sql` |
| Intermediate | `models/int/` | ephemeral | `int_<description>.sql` |
| Dimensions | `models/dim/` | table | `dim_<entity>.sql` |
| Maps | `models/map/` | table | `map_<entity>.sql` |
| Facts | `models/fct/` | table | `fct_<event>.sql` |
| Marts | `models/mart/` | table or view | `mart_<use_case>.sql` |

**SAP invoice facts:** `fct_inv_sap_<suffix>` — `core` (shared spine), `cd`, `otp`, `wco`, etc. Same `sap_inv_key` grain; `_sap` = SAP authoritative source.

**Tags:** `core` on shared models; `cash_discount` on CD product models. Select ancestors with `+tag:<name>` (e.g. `dbt build --select +tag:cash_discount`).

**Spine:** `fct_inv_sap_core` → `fct_inv_sap_cd` (product extension). 

## SQL style

- Use CTEs; one logical step per CTE with a clear name.
- Prefer explicit column lists over `SELECT *` in final outputs.
- Reference sources with `{{ source('...', '...') }}` and models with `{{ ref('...') }}`.
- Core cross-system fields: enrich via `map_inv_sap_coupa`, not SAP posting ref → Coupa alone.
- Add schema YAML (`models/<layer>/_<layer>__models.yml`) for docs and tests.

## dbt commands (run from this folder)

```bash
dbt debug
dbt run
dbt test
dbt build
```

## What not to commit

- Credentials: keep `profiles.yml` in `~/.dbt/`, not in this repo.
- Generated dirs: `target/`, `dbt_packages/`, `logs/`.

## When a decision is made in chat

Add a dated entry to the **relevant** log so future chats stay aligned:

- Core / shared AP → ap_core repo `docs/core_decisions.md` (update Model inventory there when models change).
- Cash discount only → `docs/decisions.md` (update Model inventory there when models change).

## Handoff format (mandatory)

See also Conventions in ap_core `docs/core_decisions.md` and `docs/decisions.md` when those sections exist.

- Proposed **decisions** additions: one copy-paste block per entry (full section text). Path = ap_core `docs/core_decisions.md` or `docs/decisions.md` depending on scope.
- Proposed **seed, model, test, or YAML** changes: **complete file contents** for every path mentioned — not bullet instructions like “update the test” or “add a CTE”.
- If only one hunk changes, still provide either the **full file** or a **single fenced block** labeled with the exact path that can replace the entire file.
- **No exceptions:** the reader must be able to implement without opening the chat for missing lines.
